B.at5=s(["Pandlish tuy\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed1i kh\xf4ng b\xe1n, cho thu\xea hay trao \u0111\u1ed5i tr\xe1i ph\xe9p d\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n d\u01b0\u1edbi m\u1ecdi h\xecnh th\u1ee9c theo Lu\u1eadt 91/2025/QH15.","Theo \u0111\u1ea1o lu\u1eadt CCPA / CPRA (California), ch\xfang m\xecnh kh\xf4ng \u201cb\xe1n\u201d th\xf4ng tin c\xe1 nh\xe2n; b\u1ea1n lu\xf4n c\xf3 th\u1ec3 t\u1eaft qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o c\xe1 nh\xe2n ho\xe1 trong c\xe0i \u0111\u1eb7t h\u1ec7 \u0111i\u1ec1u h\xe0nh ho\u1eb7c n\xe2ng c\u1ea5p g\xf3i Th\xe1ng / N\u0103m.","Ch\xfang m\xecnh kh\xf4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng d\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi h\u1ecdc \u0111\u1ec3 hu\u1ea5n luy\u1ec7n m\xf4 h\xecnh AI b\xean ngo\xe0i hay ra quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng g\xe2y h\u1ec7 qu\u1ea3 ph\xe1p l\xfd."],t.s)
