B.aIx=new A.cq("\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xf9ng ch\u01b0a \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd g\xf3i Th\xe1ng ho\u1eb7c N\u0103m, \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng di \u0111\u1ed9ng hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n do Google AdMob cung c\u1ea5p g\u1ed3m: (1) m\u1ed9t banner nh\u1ecf g\u1ecdn c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh \u1edf m\xe9p d\u01b0\u1edbi m\xe0n h\xecnh ch\xednh (t\u1ef1 \u1ea9n khi m\u1edf b\xe0n ph\xedm ho\u1eb7c m\xe0n h\xecnh nh\u1ecf) v\xe0 (2) qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o video c\xf3 th\u01b0\u1edfng ho\xe0n to\xe0n t\u1ef1 nguy\u1ec7n khi b\u1ea1n ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng b\u1ea5m xem. Pandlish cam k\u1ebft kh\xf4ng hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o to\xe0n m\xe0n h\xecnh t\u1ef1 b\u1eadt (interstitial) v\xe0 kh\xf4ng bao gi\u1edd hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o trong l\xfac \u0111ang h\u1ecdc th\u1ebb t\u1eeb hay ch\u01a1i tr\xf2 ch\u01a1i.")
B.a9V=s(["SDK Google AdMob c\xf3 th\u1ec3 x\u1eed l\xfd \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 IP, th\xf4ng tin thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n, t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\xe1c qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o v\xe0 m\xe3 qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o Android (AAID) \u0111\u1ec3 ph\xe2n ph\u1ed1i qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o v\xe0 ch\u1ed1ng gian l\u1eadn theo Ch\xednh s\xe1ch quy\u1ec1n ri\xeang t\u01b0 c\u1ee7a Google (policies.google.com/privacy).","Tr\xean iOS, Pandlish kh\xf4ng y\xeau c\u1ea7u quy\u1ec1n App Tracking Transparency (ATT) v\xe0 kh\xf4ng truy c\u1eadp m\xe3 \u0111\u1ecbnh danh IDFA.","B\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 theo \u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i: n\u1ebfu ng\u01b0\u1eddi h\u1ecdc d\u01b0\u1edbi 13 tu\u1ed5i (ho\u1eb7c ch\u01b0a x\xe1c \u0111\u1ecbnh \u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i), SDK AdMob t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng kho\xe1 \u1edf ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 d\xe0nh cho tr\u1ebb em (tagForChildDirectedTreatment), x\u1ebfp h\u1ea1ng n\u1ed9i dung m\u1ee9c G v\xe0 t\u1eaft ho\xe0n to\xe0n qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o c\xe1 nh\xe2n ho\xe1.","T\u1ea1i EEA, V\u01b0\u01a1ng qu\u1ed1c Anh, Th\u1ee5y S\u0129 v\xe0 c\xe1c khu v\u1ef1c \xe1p d\u1ee5ng, bi\u1ec3u m\u1eabu Google UMP xin \xfd ki\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ed3ng \xfd tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi t\u1ea3i qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o.","Pandlish kh\xf4ng chia s\u1ebb email, t\xean, ti\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ed9 h\u1ecdc hay n\u1ed9i dung t\xe0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n cho m\u1ea1ng qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o."],t.s)
