B.aIr=new A.cq("Pandlish welcomes learners of all ages. On first launch, an on-device age gate tailors safety protections without transmitting birth dates to our servers:")
B.aeZ=s(["Learners under 13 can study offline in Guest mode with zero account data collected, and any AdMob requests are locked to child-directed, G-rated, non-personalized ads compliant with COPPA and Google Play Families / Apple Kids standards.","In Vietnam (under 16), the US (under 13), and the EU / UK (under 13\u201316 depending on member state), creating an online synced account for a child requires verifiable parent or guardian consent.","Parents and guardians may review, update, or delete a child's account at any time. Any child account discovered without valid guardian consent is promptly deleted."],t.s)
